<p>Roohe Shariyat Hai Yeh Gham.</p>

<p> Jaane Ibadat Hai Matam.</p>

<p> 1. Hai Yahi Eema&rsquo;N Hum Sabka.</p>

<p>Aik Hai Qura&rsquo;N Aik Quda.</p>

<p>Padhte Hai Hum Jiska Kalma.</p>

<p>Uske Nawase Ka Hai Gham.</p>

<p> 2. Majlis E Sarwar Jannat Hai.</p>

<p>Sabse Badi Yeh Nemat Hai.</p>

<p>Dil Meim Aik Hi Hasrat Hai.</p>

<p>Farshe Aza Par Nikle Dam.</p>

<p>3. Hai Mafhoom Mawaddat Ka.</p>

<p>Hai Yeh Qulasa Sunnat Ka.</p>

<p>Hai Yeh Taqaza Fitrat Ka.</p>

<p>Dil Mein Basalo Sheh Ka Gham.</p>

<p> 4. Sabse Juda Hai Inka Muqaam.</p>

<p>Ashke Aza Hai Inka Naam.</p>

<p>Jhuk Ke Inhein Karte Hai Salaam.</p>

<p>Chashma E Kousar Aur Zam Zam.</p>

<p>5. Haq Pe Jiyo Aur Haq Pe Maro.</p>

<p>Zalim Ke Aage Na Jhuko.</p>

<p>Matam Sheh Ka Karte Raho.</p>

<p>Jab Tak Hai Seene Mein Dam.</p>

<p>6. Qasim Ibne Shabbar Asws., Ke.</p>

<p>Hum Hai Azadar Akbar Asws., Ke.</p>

<p>Matami Hum Hai Asghar Asws., Ke.</p>

<p>Hum Pe Hai Yeh Zehra Sa., Ka Karam.</p>

<p> 7. Pehne Hue Ehraam E Aza.</p>

<p>Qafila Anjuman Asghari Ka.</p>

<p>Pohonchega Ek Din Karbobala.</p>

<p>Karta Hua Qooni Matam.</p>

<p> 8. Kehta Hun Ehle Eemaa&rsquo;N Se.</p>

<p>Laakh Nisha&rsquo;N Ho Sajdo&rsquo;N Ke.</p>

<p>Laazim Hai Jannat Ke Liye.</p>

<p>Seene Pe Ho Daaghe Matam.</p>

<p> 9. Saqi E Kousar Ka Kunba.</p>

<p>Teen Dino Tak Tha Pyasa.</p>

<p>Shaane Kataye Labe Darya.</p>

<p>Qatl Hua Saqqa E Haram.</p>

<p> 10. Kehte Raho Yawar Yeh Baat.</p>

<p>Thakte Nahi Matam Ke Haath.</p>

<p>Sardi Ho Garmi Ya Baraaat.</p>

<p>Thak Jaata Hai Har Mausam.</p>

<p>Az: Shayer E Ahlebait Janab Yawar Ali Yawar Sahab.</p>